  https://github.com/yausername/youtubedl-android/tree/0.18.1
- yt-dlp 2026.08.19: Unlicense; pinned in runtime.properties and reported in Diagnostics.
  https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp/releases/tag/2026.08.19
- Python: Python Software Foundation License.
  https://www.python.org/psf/license/
