  https://github.com/Legrandin/pycryptodome/blob/v3.23.0/LICENSE.rst
- OpenSSL, observed 3.5.2 through Python ssl on x86_64: Apache-2.0.
  https://github.com/openssl/openssl/blob/openssl-3.5.2/LICENSE.txt
